  "summary": "Wide, low and patient. The mech you put where the line must not move.",
  "lore": "The BWK is a Compact siege hull with the hips widened and the legs cut down, a modification Sarn made once by accident and then kept because the resulting stance is almost impossible to knock over. It walks at twelve metres a second and does not care. Ridgeward militias buy them second-hand and park them across roads, which is, in fairness, exactly what they are for.",
